# The Craft Anything engine this shell drives: our fork of storytold/craft-anything, built as
# craft-anything-cli and run as `craft-anything-cli mcp`. Sourced by pin-engine.sh.
# To move the pin, rebase our commits on the fork's `native` branch (the ones after UPSTREAM_BASE) onto
# upstream `main` and run the engine's checks. Then set CRAFT_ANYTHING_COMMIT to the rebased head and
# UPSTREAM_BASE(_DATE) to the upstream commit, and run pin-engine.sh and the shell's tests again.
CRAFT_ANYTHING_COMMIT=0581029f7b94250ea5e432a11c3dfaa704f5d15e
CRAFT_ANYTHING_BRANCH=native
UPSTREAM_BASE=fc93bd091e7810e08b540a67487e3bf5f2b7da2b
UPSTREAM_BASE_DATE=2026-11-05
